      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validate incoming e-invoices\n\n1. In **New Email**, connect your invoice mailbox (IMAP credentials).\n2. In **Validate E-Invoice**, select your invoapi credentials.\n3. Replace the two placeholders on the right with your own steps, e.g. *Google Drive* to file valid invoices and *Send Email* to ask the sender for a corrected invoice, listing `errors`.\n\nEach attachment is checked against the official rules (KoSIT). `valid` is true or false; `errors` lists each rule with an explanation.",
        "width": 600,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
